{"availability":"available","full":"FMelloRodrigo/menelway_astro_planner","name":"menelway_astro_planner","description":"Menelway is a application for deep-sky astrophotography session planning and equipment preview. Supports desktop and mobile.","category":"Other","language":"Dart","stars":0,"forks":0,"created":"2026-09-05T23:39:23Z","updated":"2026-10-11T01:50:46Z","license":"MIT","branch":"main","homepage":"https://fmellorodrigo.github.io/menelway_astro_planner/","topics":[],"demo":"https://fmellorodrigo.github.io/menelway_astro_planner/","color":"#193546","ink":"#a6d6e8","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-11T06:14:57.415Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-11T06:14:57.415Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-11T06:14:57.415Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-11T06:14:57.415Z","stars":0,"forks":0}],"technologies":[],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["MENELWAY is a high-performance application for deep-sky astrophotography session planning, supporting desktop and mobile environments. It couples a fast C++ calculation core with a modern Flutter user interface, running offline with self-contained databases and ephemerides."],"features":["Comprehensive Object Catalogs: Over 13,000 deep-sky objects (Messier, Caldwell, NGC, IC, Arp, Herschel 400), plus solar system planets and 80+ navigational/bright stars with real-time VSOP87/ELP2000 ephemeris…","Deep-Sky & Night Filtering: Real-time altitude curves, transit times, darkness intervals (civil, nautical, astronomical dusk/dawn), moon separation, and moon illumination calculation.","Yearly Observing Window: Annual visibility solver computing rise/set curves across all 365 days, optimal observation windows, and peak observing dates.","Period Planner: Search targets observable within future date intervals (e.g. upcoming 7 days, 14 days, next month) with Moon phase analysis.","Equipment Framing Simulator: Focal length and sensor dimension framing simulator with FOV overlays, visual target dimensions, and interactive panning and zooming."